tle\">POxy.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">276.8</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(i A.D.)</span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><span class=\"lex-n\">f</span> with <span class=\"gk\">κατά, καθ' ἓν ἕκαστον</span> each <b class=\"lex-tr\">singly,</b> piece by piece, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.9</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">καθ' ἕν</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">one</b> by <b class=\"lex-tr\">one,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Sph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">217a</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">καθ' ἕν, <span class=\"lex-gram\">τό</span>,</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">list,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">PEleph.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20.7</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(iii B.C.)</span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">καθ' ἕν' ἡμῶν ἕκαστον ἀποστερεῖν</span> to deprive each of us <b class=\"lex-tr\">singly,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">21.142</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Men.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Epit.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">164</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">186</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">εἷς κατὰ εἷς</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">one</b> by <b class=\"lex-tr\">one,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ev.Marc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.19</span> </span>; but <span class=\"gk\">καθ' ἓν γίγνεσθαι, εἶναι,</span> to be <b class=\"lex-tr\">united,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.46</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</c